  "oracle": {
    "kind": "native",
    "name": "Power Pages basic form postback",
    "version": "2026-11-27",
    "scope": "Two signed-in browser runs (a, b) of hosted session F2 on an Enhanced, Bootstrap 5 site with enhanced authorization enabled (enhancedauthorization 3) (Site/EnableCustomPluginError absent), one form postback per scenario of the invented pqf2 schema: the HTTP status, the form's message panel kind and text, and the validation summary entries after range, format and length refusals, choices posts (valid, outside the options, malformed, empty), request validation of a script block, current-contact activity party inserts on ten party list columns, a wrong CAPTCHA answer and a geolocation form insert. It does not establish stored values, plug-in messages or the rendered page around the panel. The exact hosted build is unrecorded."
  },
